<?xml version='1.0' encoding='UTF-8'?><oois xmlns="http://www.outdooractive.com/api/"><tour id="7851464" type="5250" frontendtype="tour" ranking="71.0"><category id="1589846" name="Trails" iconUrl="https://res3.oastatic.com/icons/alpstein/mountainbiking/maroon/mountainbiking.square_vector.svg" iconInactiveUrl="https://res.oastatic.com/icons/alpstein/mountainbiking/grey80/mountainbiking.square_vector.svg" iconMapUrl="https://res3.oastatic.com/icons/alpstein/mountainbiking/maroon/mountainbiking.map_vector.svg" iconInactiveMapUrl="https://res.oastatic.com/icons/alpstein/mountainbiking/grey80/mountainbiking.map_vector.svg" iconTransparentUrl="https://res3.oastatic.com/icons/alpstein/mountainbiking/mountainbiking.geocontent.png" strokeColor="#ff0000" mapOverlays="mtb"><datatype>mountainbiking</datatype></category><title>SH 92 Wetterkreuz-Trail am Reiterkogel</title><localizedTitle lang="en"><value>SH 92 Wetterkreuz Trail at Reiterkogel</value></localizedTitle><localizedTitle lang="fr"><value>SH 92 Wetterkreuz-Trail au Reiterkogel</value></localizedTitle><localizedTitle lang="es"><value>SH 92 Wetterkreuz-Trail am Reiterkogel</value></localizedTitle><localizedTitle lang="it"><value>SH 92 Wetterkreuz-Trail am Reiterkogel</value></localizedTitle><shortText>&lt;p>Schön angelegter Trail, der richtig Würze in jede MTB-Tour am Reiterkogel bringt. Ideal für Enduro- und Tourenfahrer.&lt;/p>&#xd;
&#xd;
&lt;p>&lt;strong>Achtung: Es handelt sich um einen SHARED TRAIL - dieser wird auch von Wanderern genutzt. Bitte um Anpassung der Fahrweise, Fahren auf Sicht und ein respektvolles Miteinander!&lt;/strong>&lt;/p>&#xd;
&#xd;
&lt;p>&lt;strong>Dieser Trail ist unbeaufsichtigt und wird nicht permanent gewartet. Die Befahrung erfolgt auf eigene Gefahr. Entlang der Strecke gibt es keine besondere Gefahrensicherung. Aus diesem Grund erfolgt keine offizielle Angabe, ob der Trail geöffnet oder geschlossen ist. Auf sämtlichen durch den Tourismusverband und die Bergbahnen ausgewiesenen Mountainbike-Strecken gilt die Straßenverkehrsordnung (StVO)!&lt;/strong>&lt;/p></shortText><longText>&lt;p>&lt;strong>Enduro-Spaß für Jedermann&lt;/strong>&lt;/p>&#xd;
&lt;p>Der einfache Singletrail führt euch bis zur Reiteralm. Als krönenden Abschluss führt eine Forststraße vorbei am Heilkräuterweg und retour zur Bergstation der Reiterkogelbahn, wo Pro-Line und Blue-Line bereits auf euch warten.&lt;/p></longText><primaryImage id="7851498"><author>Bernhard Niederseer</author></primaryImage><geometry>12.596082,47.406101,1634 12.596092,47.406087,1634 12.596017,47.405976,1630 12.59601,47.405897,1629 12.596033,47.405774,1628 12.596051,47.405684,1628 12.596025,47.405584,1629 12.596035,47.405577,1629 12.596035,47.405577,1638 12.596063,47.405556,1638 12.596113,47.405526,1638 12.596131,47.405502,1638 12.596152,47.405464,1638 12.596167,47.405427,1638 12.596192,47.405387,1638 12.59623,47.405341,1638 12.596251,47.405324,1637 12.596288,47.405302,1637 12.596323,47.405283,1636 12.596355,47.405188,1636 12.596377,47.405151,1635 12.596414,47.405122,1635 12.596476,47.405072,1633 12.596533,47.405024,1632 12.596596,47.404956,1630 12.596637,47.404904,1629 12.596662,47.404869,1629 12.596705,47.404856,1628 12.596726,47.404839,1627 12.596744,47.404799,1627 12.596823,47.404714,1626 12.596885,47.404662,1625 12.596905,47.404637,1624 12.596927,47.404589,1624 12.596952,47.404554,1624 12.596996,47.404522,1623 12.597064,47.404467,1621 12.597106,47.404419,1619 12.597131,47.404368,1619 12.597168,47.40428,1618 12.597191,47.404198,1617 12.597204,47.40415,1617 12.597215,47.404109,1616 12.597207,47.404071,1617 12.597221,47.40404,1616 12.597252,47.404008,1615 12.597271,47.40397,1614 12.597292,47.403924,1614 12.597385,47.403745,1611 12.597393,47.403676,1611 12.597396,47.403533,1611 12.59738,47.403426,1612 12.597406,47.40332,1611 12.597515,47.403165,1607 12.597682,47.402955,1600 12.597762,47.402841,1596 12.597774,47.40273,1596 12.597784,47.402642,1596 12.597729,47.402521,1600 12.59765,47.402401,1605 12.597646,47.402394,1606 12.597661,47.402352,1606 12.597724,47.402326,1605 12.597814,47.4023,1602 12.597864,47.402255,1601 12.5979,47.402205,1601 12.597917,47.402135,1603 12